---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /free-tools/
title: Free resources
description: Free Mapped & Managed tools for IEP data, small-group tracking and MTSS progress monitoring, and free Indiana ILEARN ELA checkpoint screeners for grades 3-8.
ogImage: /media/videos/mm12-group-snapshot.jpg
ogImageWidth: 1280
ogImageHeight: 720
---
{%- from "partials/macros.njk" import cover_card, product_card -%}
{%- set L = ela.listings -%}
<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Start free</p>
    <h1>Free resources</h1>
    <p class="lead">Every one is a real, complete resource, delivered through Teachers Pay Teachers so it lands in your TPT account with every future update.</p>
    <nav class="lane-chips mt-2" aria-label="Jump to a section">
      <a class="chip" href="#mapped-managed" style="--accent:{{ site.colors.sage }}"><span class="chip-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>Mapped &amp; Managed tools</a>
      <a class="chip" href="#ela" style="--accent:{{ site.lanes.ela.color }}"><span class="chip-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>Indiana ILEARN ELA screeners</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--paper" id="mapped-managed">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Mapped &amp; Managed &middot; Free tools</p>
    <h2>A free tool for IEP, small-group and MTSS data</h2>
    <p class="lead">Open any one to see inside. Some send the download to your inbox; the rest go straight to the free listing on TPT.</p>
    <div class="grid grid--3 mt-2">
      {%- for f in products %}{% if f.free %}
      {{ product_card(f, f.laneLabel) }}
      {%- endif %}{% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="ela">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow" style="color:{{ site.lanes.ela.color | ink }}">Indiana ILEARN ELA &middot; Free screeners</p>
    <h2>Find out who is ready before the window opens</h2>
    <p class="lead">One question on every standard Indiana assesses in that checkpoint, and a class tracker that prints the standard under every question number. There is one for each grade and checkpoint, and one file for each grade band.</p>
    {%- for cp in [1, 2, 3] %}
    <h3 class="mt-2">Checkpoint {{ cp }} &middot; {{ ["", "fall", "winter", "spring"][cp] }} window</h3>
    <div class="grid grid--4">
      {%- for key in ela.order %}{% set r = L[key] %}{% if r.free and r.cp == cp %}
      {{ cover_card("/indiana-ela/" + r.key + "/", r.cover, r.color, r.gradeLabel + " · Free", r.title, "", "See it →") }}
      {%- endif %}{% endfor %}
    </div>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
